   428	/// @notice Deploys `Distribution` clones to an address that depends on this factory and a salt alone.
   429	/// @dev No `receive` and no `fallback`, so ETH sent to the factory itself reverts; the implementation
   430	/// rejects it too. Clones are PUSH0 minimal proxies placed with CREATE2, so the same factory reaches
   431	/// the same clone address on every chain.
