    rake src/ and deploy scripts at 94d028c, for a blind two-model review
    
    The third review of these contracts. The tree holds nothing but the code
    in audits/SCOPE, the runner, and the prompts: no docs/, no test/, no
    app/, no README.md, no SECURITY.md and no audits/KNOWN_ANSWER.md, which
    stays in the rake checkout and reaches the rollup only through
    KNOWN_ANSWER_FILE. A prompt cannot make a leg blind to the filesystem it
    is pointed at, so the filesystem is the blind.
    
    Reviewed commit, in dnznlabs/rake:
